{"page_id": "docparsing_images-images_54fa05a6_images_education_english_00027-p1", "markdown": "7 Talk, write and tell Work in groups.\n\n- Bring a picture of your favourite singer or actor.\n- Write what he/she looks like. Use the words in the box.\n\nblack hair straight hair blonde hair\n\ntall\n\nshort\n\ncool\n\ncute\n\nbeautiful\n\nthin\n\nbig\n\nstrong\n\nc. Tell the class about your favourite singer or actor.\n\nThis is my favourite singer.\n\nShe is short and thin.\n\nShe has long, black hair.\n\nI think she is beautiful.\n\n18\n\neighteen", "width": 510, "height": 712, "blocks": [{"kind": "text", "text": "7 Talk, write and tell Work in groups.", "bbox": {"x": 27.073875334938407, "y": 14.401997495420554, "width": 217.39253234863284, "height": 62.78682708740239}}, {"kind": "list", "text": "Bring a picture of your favourite singer or actor. Write what he/she looks like. Use the words in the box.", "bbox": {"x": 51.99999987303599, "y": 75.99999999402623, "width": 398, "height": 64}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "black hair straight hair blonde hair", "bbox": {"x": 237.99999988990828, "y": 215.99999999266055, "width": 243.99999999999997, "height": 15.999999999999961}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "tall", "bbox": {"x": 79.99999989166668, "y": 249.99999995000002, "width": 25.999999999999993, "height": 11.99999999999995}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "short", "bbox": {"x": 123.99999963333335, "y": 247.9999997666667, "width": 42.00000000000001, "height": 13.999999999999915}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "cool", "bbox": {"x": 183.9999999066667, "y": 249.99999996000005, "width": 32, "height": 11.99999999999995}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "cute", "bbox": {"x": 79.99999989333334, "y": 347.99999996, "width": 32, "height": 11.99999999999995}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "beautiful", "bbox": {"x": 151.98580540829502, "y": 345.93482062921714, "width": 64.02838897705077, "height": 14.130358695983833}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "thin", "bbox": {"x": 255.99999984444443, "y": 345.99999991111